       "awb---key-feature-1-content": "<h3>Six silly answers sort the offsite into teams</h3><p>Before the offsite, all 40 people answer silly multiple choice questions, like which office appliance they would be. The survey sorts them into 5 teams of 8, with no more than 2 people from any department on a team. Team Toaster ends up with people from 4 departments.</p>"
      }
     },
