       "awb---mockup-data": "<p id=\"\">window.awbMockup = { annualReaderSurvey: \"Build an annual reader survey for my weekly cooking newsletter. Ask readers to rate each of our 5 sections from 1 to 5, with a comment box under each rating. Save every answer with the subscriber's email and the survey year. If any section averages under 3.0, email that section's scores and comments to the editor.\", signupQuestions: \"Add 2 questions to my newsletter signup: the reader's role, and which freight lane they follow, from a list of 4 lanes. Save both answers on the subscriber's row as tags, and sync the tags to my email tool through its API so I can send each lane its own edition.\", sendFrequency: \"Add one question to the footer of my daily gardening digest: how often do you want this newsletter, with daily, twice a week, and weekly as the choices. Count the answers in a bar chart, and show how many readers picked each choice and its share of the total.\", staffNewsletter: \"Build a survey for my company's monthly staff newsletter. Ask each employee whether they read the last issue and which section helped them most. Save the employee's site with each answer, and show a table of answers and the share who read it for each of our 3 sites.\" };</p>"
      }
     },
     {
