       "awb---mockup-data": "<p id=\"\">window.awbMockup = { orderSource: \"Build a one-question survey for my candle shop's order confirmation page. Ask first-time buyers how they first heard of the shop: podcast ad, a friend, Instagram, search, or other. Save each answer with the order number and show me the count for each source by month.\", deliveryCheck: \"Build a delivery check for my pantry goods store. When an order is marked delivered, text the buyer one question: did it arrive complete and intact? Options: yes, late, damaged, or missing an item. Post every damaged or missing answer to our support channel in Slack with the order number.\", fitAndSizing: \"Build a fit survey for my outdoor clothing store. Ten days after delivery, ask buyers of each pair of pants whether it runs small, true to size, or large, and which size they ordered. Show the answers by product so I can see which styles run small.\", reorderTiming: \"Build a survey for one-time buyers of my coffee. Ask how long a bag will last them: 2 weeks, 3 weeks, 4 weeks, or not buying again. Email each buyer a reorder reminder in the week they picked, and ask anyone not buying again one question about why.\" };</p>"
      }
